---

## 1. Dependencies and Libraries

### Recommended Approach: Spring AI MCP Server Starter

Spring AI provides official MCP server support with the `spring-ai-starter-mcp-server` starters. This is the recommended approach as it integrates seamlessly with Spring Boot.

