</div>

<!-- WhatsApp Assistance -->
<div class="payment-option" onclick="window.open('https://wa.me/[REDACTED]?text=...')">
    Assistance / Autres moyens →
</div>
```

**Parameters passed to MTN payment page:**
```php
$urlParams = "user=$userId&plan=" . urlencode($plan) . 
